#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:90
msgid ""
"Instead of the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key, other keys can be used to input "
"the data in the current cell. These other keys will move the selection box "
"to other locations than does the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key. The "
"<keysym>Tab</keysym> key inputs the entry in the currently selected cell and"
" then moves the selection box one cell to the right of the current cell. The"
" arrow keys input the entry into the currently selected cell and move one "
"cell in the direction of the arrow. The <keysym>Enter</keysym> key can also "
"be used in conjunction with other keys. Typing the "
"<keycombo><keysym>Shift</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo> "
"combination will move the selection upwards after entry. Typing the "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo> combination"
" will re-select the currently selected cell."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda andra tangenter än <keysym>Enter</keysym> för att mata in "
"data i den aktuella cellen och flytta markeringen på andra sätt än med "
"<keysym>Enter</keysym>. <keysym>Tab</keysym> matar in värdet i den markerade"
" cellen och flyttar markeringen en cell åt höger. Piltangenterna matar in "
"värdet och flyttar markeringen en cell i pilens riktning. Du kan också "
"kombinera <keysym>Enter</keysym> med andra tangenter. "
"<keycombo><keysym>Shift</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo> flyttar "
"markeringen uppåt efter inmatningen. "
"<keycombo><keysym>Ctrl</keysym><keysym>Enter</keysym></keycombo> markerar "
"den aktuella cellen igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:113
msgid ""
"After selecting the cell and initially entering the data, the user is in a "
"limited editing mode. The main key for editing mistakes in this mode is the "
"backspace key."
msgstr ""
"När du har markerat cellen och börjat mata in data är du i ett begränsat "
"redigeringsläge. I det läget använder du främst Backsteg för att rätta "
"misstag."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:119
msgid ""
"For a more complete set of editing options, especially for longer entries, "
"there is an advanced editing mode. To enter the advanced editing mode, press"
" the <keycap>F2</keycap> function key or click on the editing region. The "
"keyboard focus will then shift from the current cell to the editing region "
"at the top of the worksheet. There, you can use cursor keys to position the "
"cursor within the data in the cell, and have all of the capabilities of the "
"data entry area available."
msgstr ""
"För fler redigeringsalternativ, särskilt vid längre inmatningar, kan du "
"använda det avancerade redigeringsläget. Tryck på funktionstangenten "
"<keycap>F2</keycap> eller klicka i redigeringsområdet för att öppna det. "
"Tangentbordsfokus flyttas då från den aktuella cellen till "
"redigeringsområdet högst upp i kalkylbladet. Där kan du använda "
"piltangenterna för att flytta markören i cellens innehåll och använda alla "
"funktioner i inmatningsfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:130
msgid ""
"For example, you can use: <_:variablelist-1/> See <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"entry\"/> For more info on the data entry area."
msgstr ""
"Du kan till exempel använda: <_:variablelist-1/> Mer information om "
"inmatningsfältet finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-entry\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:152
msgid ""
"All the normal key bindings for GNOME application entry boxes also apply in "
"the data entry box."
msgstr ""
"Alla vanliga tangentbordsgenvägar för GNOME-programmens inmatningsfält "
"fungerar även i inmatningsfältet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:158
msgid ""
"After finishing the data entry, pressing the <keycap>Enter</keycap> key will"
" input the data entry and move the selection box downward just like for the "
"simple editing mode."
msgstr ""
"När du har matat in data trycker du på <keycap>Enter</keycap> för att "
"slutföra inmatningen och flytta markeringen nedåt, precis som i det enkla "
"redigeringsläget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:174
msgid ""
"Text can be entered by selecting a cell, typing the text and then typing the"
" <keysym>Enter</keysym> key. Anything that is not interpreted to be a "
"number, boolean, formula or error will be treated as a text field. To "
"prevent <application>Gnumeric</application> from interpreting an entry as "
"one of these other elements, a leading apostrophe can be added to force the "
"entry to be text. Any entry, no matter what the contents, which starts with "
"a leading apostrophe (') will be considered to be text."
msgstr ""
"Markera en cell, skriv texten och tryck på <keysym>Enter</keysym> för att "
"mata in text. Allt som inte tolkas som ett tal, ett booleskt värde, en "
"formel eller ett fel behandlas som text. Om du vill hindra "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> från att tolka inmatningen som någon av "
"dessa andra typer kan du inleda den med en apostrof. All inmatning som "
"börjar med apostrof (') betraktas som text, oavsett innehåll."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:187
msgid ""
"Postal codes in the United States are series of five integers. By default, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> interprets these to be numbers. This "
"interpretation means that the leading zeros used in the postal codes of the "
"northeastern region will be lost by default. To retain these leading zeros, "
"either the code should be entered with a leading apostrophe (e.g. '02917) or"
" the cells should be formatted as text before data entry (see <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-data-format\"/> for an explanation of formatting)."
msgstr ""
"Postnummer i USA består av fem siffror. Som standard tolkar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> dem som tal, vilket gör att inledande "
"nollor, som används i nordöstra USA, försvinner. Behåll nollorna genom att "
"inleda koden med en apostrof (till exempel '02917) eller formatera cellerna "
"som text innan du matar in data. Se <xref linkend=\"sect-data-format\"/> om "
"cellformatering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:206
msgid ""
"Numbers can be entered like other items. First the cell in which the number "
"should be entered must be selected, then a valid number must be typed in and"
" finally the entry must be inserted using the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key. "
"The valid formats for numbers are presented in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"numbers\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Tal matas in på samma sätt som andra värden. Markera först cellen, skriv ett"
" giltigt tal och tryck sedan på <keysym>Enter</keysym>. Giltiga talformat "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-numbers\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:224
msgid ""
"A boolean can be entered by selecting the cell, typing the boolean (either "
"TRUE or FALSE) and then typing the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key."
msgstr ""
"Mata in ett booleskt värde genom att markera cellen, skriva TRUE eller FALSE"
" och trycka på <keysym>Enter</keysym>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:236
msgid ""
"Formulas can be entered simply by typing a syntactically correct formula in "
"a cell. The correct syntax for formulas is explained in detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-data-formulas\"/>. Formulas begin with an equals sign (=) and"
" contain arithmetic symbols, functions with their arguments and cell "
"references."
msgstr ""
"Formler matas in genom att skriva en formel med korrekt syntax i en cell. "
"Syntaxen förklaras närmare i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas\"/>. Formler"
" börjar med likhetstecknet (=) och kan innehålla räknesymboler, funktioner "
"med argument och cellreferenser."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:244
msgid ""
"To enter a formula, first the cell must be selected, then the correct "
"formula must be typed, and finally the <keysym>Enter</keysym> key must be "
"typed."
msgstr ""
"Markera först cellen där formeln ska stå, skriv formeln korrekt och tryck "
"sedan på <keysym>Enter</keysym>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:251
msgid ""
"If the formula entered into <application>Gnumeric</application> cannot be "
"interpreted correctly, <application>Gnumeric</application> will display an "
"error message giving the user the choice of re-editing the formula or saving"
" the formula as a text field to be edited later. For example, a formula may "
"be mathematically incorrect if the user has two operators in a row (e.g. "
"=3+*4). If the formula is saved as text, when the formula is corrected the "
"leading apostrophe must be removed. <application>Gnumeric</application> will"
" then re-interpret the entry as a formula."
msgstr ""
"Om <application>Gnumeric</application> inte kan tolka en inmatad formel "
"korrekt visar <application>Gnumeric</application> ett felmeddelande med "
"möjlighet att redigera formeln igen eller spara den som text för senare "
"redigering. Formeln kan till exempel vara matematiskt felaktig om två "
"operatorer står efter varandra (till exempel =3+*4). Om formeln sparas som "
"text måste den inledande apostrofen tas bort när den har rättats. Då tolkar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> inmatningen som en formel igen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:270
msgid ""
"Formulas often include cell references or references to ranges of cells as "
"arguments to functions. These references and ranges can be entered into a "
"formula simply by typing in the proper syntax (see <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"data-formulas-references\"/> for more details). But manually entering in "
"cell ranges is slow and cumbersome. In order to speed up the entry of these "
"cell ranges, the mouse and the keyboard arrow keys can be used to select "
"these cell ranges quickly."
msgstr ""
"Formler innehåller ofta cellreferenser eller cellområden som "
"funktionsargument. Du kan skriva in referenser och områden direkt i formeln "
"med rätt syntax; se <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-references\"/>. Det "
"kan dock vara långsamt och omständligt att skriva in cellområden för hand. "
"Använd musen eller piltangenterna för att välja områden snabbare."
